   "excerpt": "<style id='1'>30 </style>AramcoWorld"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#1",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 181.648,
   "first_line_x": 199.223,
   "offset": 17.575,
   "lines": 5,
   "excerpt": "这些历史遗迹还面临着来自暴雨和其他因素导致的湿气积聚以及材料自然老化的持续威胁。像Khakimov这样的保护主义者不断监"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#2",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 181.861,
   "first_line_x": 200.361,
   "offset": 18.5,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "然而，使这些建筑结构能够存续数百年的许多工程技术至今仍在发挥作用。"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#3",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 181.509,
   "first_line_x": 197.234,
   "offset": 15.725,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "“任何超过百年的建筑遗迹都像一位智慧的长者，”哈基莫夫说，“它随着时间的推移而稳定下来。”"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#4",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 388.746,
   "first_line_x": 407.246,
   "offset": 18.5,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "他解释说，一些纪念碑下的地基包含了用来吸收地震时震动的芦苇层。"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#5",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 388.657,
   "first_line_x": 405.307,
   "offset": 16.65,
   "lines": 4,
   "excerpt": "“例如，这座纪念碑{v1}Tilya-Kori神学院{v2}坐落在一个9米高的地基上，地基下有一层10厘米厚的芦苇层，”"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#6",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 399.199,
   "first_line_x": 421.199,
   "offset": 22.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "精心修复是一种使命"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#7",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 388.685,
   "first_line_x": 406.26,
   "offset": 17.575,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "修复者面临的另一个挑战是决定重建的程度。"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#8",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 388.851,
   "first_line_x": 407.351,
   "offset": 18.5,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "在Tilya-Kori神学院内，游客现在沿着曾经有装饰性石雕的大型砖面行走。"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#9",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 388.657,
   "first_line_x": 406.232,
   "offset": 17.575,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "“这些烧砖是保存区域。以前，到处都是令人惊叹的石雕。现在只剩下大约2%。”哈基莫夫说。"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#10",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 388.75,
   "first_line_x": 407.25,
   "offset": 18.5,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "修复工作试图在尽可能忠实地重建缺失部分的同时，保存现存的碎片。"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#11",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 388.666,
   "first_line_x": 404.391,
   "offset": 15.725,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "“我们已经完全修复了乌鲁伯格神学院，”他说。“现在，当你走进去时，感觉就像它一直以来就是这样。”"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#12",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 103.669,
   "first_line_x": 141.669,
   "offset": 38.0,
   "lines": 3,
   "excerpt": "“你可以使用现代工具，但修复技术最好保持不变。如果我们改变技术，这一切都会消亡。”"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#13",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 237.098,
   "first_line_x": 237.098,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "— B A K H O D I R B A LTAY E V"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#14",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 78.312,
   "first_line_x": 93.512,
   "offset": 15.2,
   "lines": 7,
   "excerpt": "夜间的灯光秀为列吉斯坦建筑群增添了戏剧性，该建筑群在保护工作者的持续努力下，幸存于地震、暴雨和自然老化。"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#15",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 34.574,
   "first_line_x": 34.0,
   "offset": -0.574,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "16344araD8R1.indd 30"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#16",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 583.726,
   "first_line_x": 583.726,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "6/{v1}/{v2}:{v3}下午"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#0",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 490.233,
   "first_line_x": 490.233,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "<style id='1'>2026年7月/8月 </style><style id='3'> </style>33"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#1",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 78.083,
   "first_line_x": 95.658,
   "offset": 17.575,
   "lines": 8,
   "excerpt": "我们大约在沙特阿拉伯西部的阿拉乌拉以南80英里（129公里）处。我在2024年春天前往那里研究希贾兹铁路，该铁路在20世"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#2",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 78.083,
   "first_line_x": 94.733,
   "offset": 16.65,
   "lines": 6,
   "excerpt": "我们出发时的那条柏油路消失了，车辆驶入了越野路段，阿尔·朱哈尼带着我们从一条小路转到另一条小路。最终，在干河床的边缘，他"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#3",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 78.065,
   "first_line_x": 94.715,
   "offset": 16.65,
   "lines": 6,
   "excerpt": "“这是我记得的第一座火车站，”阿尔·朱哈尼告诉我。它被称为穆达拉吉，其结构在这些年间保存得相当完好。“我第一次看到这个地"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#4",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 77.769,
   "first_line_x": 94.419,
   "offset": 16.65,
   "lines": 5,
   "excerpt": "我发现阿尔·朱哈尼所讲述的故事在沙特阿拉伯已被大部分遗忘。然而，希贾兹铁路帮助塑造了现代地区。在两年的时间里，为了研究我"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#5",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 78.25,
   "first_line_x": 94.9,
   "offset": 16.65,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "这场探索该地区过去的旅程，越来越多地与其未来联系在一起。"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#6",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 78.065,
   "first_line_x": 95.64,
   "offset": 17.575,
   "lines": 5,
   "excerpt": "在第一次世界大战后，希贾兹路线的不幸终结之后，其部分遗产仍然存在。在叙利亚，这条线路继续成为更广泛铁路网络的一部分。直到"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#7",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 78.157,
   "first_line_x": 92.957,
   "offset": 14.8,
   "lines": 4,
   "excerpt": "自2018年全面开通以来，沙特阿拉伯的哈拉曼高速铁路实现了奥斯曼时代希贾兹铁路未曾实现的目标：在麦加和麦地那之间建立直接"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#8",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 285.157,
   "first_line_x": 303.657,
   "offset": 18.5,
   "lines": 3,
   "excerpt": "在一个截然不同的技术和政治时代，它仍然呼应了最初项目背后的一个核心目标：缩短希贾兹的距离。"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#9",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 285.296,
   "first_line_x": 302.871,
   "offset": 17.575,
   "lines": 3,
   "excerpt": "然而，如今中东地区没有任何客运服务跨越国际边界。随着阿拉伯湾各国政府重新启动区域铁路一体化计划，这种缺失显得越来越不合常"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#10",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 285.157,
   "first_line_x": 303.657,
   "offset": 18.5,
   "lines": 8,
   "excerpt": "2025年12月，沙特阿拉伯和卡塔尔签署了一项协议，计划建设一条连接利雅得和多哈的高速电气化铁路。到2026年春天，土耳"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#11",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 78.181,
   "first_line_x": 78.181,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "陶菲克·阿尔·朱哈尼高速驾驶，虽然很难确切知道他的速度有多快，"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#12",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 78.634,
   "first_line_x": 104.492,
   "offset": 25.858,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "因为他那辆破旧的SUV上的仪表盘都不工作。他一只手放在"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#13",
   "layout_label": "fallback_line",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 78.259,
   "first_line_x": 78.259,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "方向盘下露出一条马尾辫。他的双脚在踏板间来回跳动，"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#14",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 79.021,
   "first_line_x": 79.021,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "在离合器和油门之间，很少踩到刹车。"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#15",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 510.179,
   "first_line_x": 524.579,
   "offset": 14.4,
   "lines": 12,
   "excerpt": "<style id='1'>对面</style> 一条铁路隧道穿过沙特阿拉伯塔布克以南50公里（31英里）处陡峭而岩石的"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#16",
   "layout_label": "fallback_line",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": -307.349,
   "first_line_x": -307.349,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "希贾兹"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#17",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 54.075,
   "first_line_x": 54.075,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "<style id='1'>铁路？</style><style id='3'>铁路？</style>"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#18",
   "layout_label": "fallback_line",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 34.574,
   "first_line_x": 34.0,
   "offset": -0.574,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "16344araD9R1.indd 33"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#19",
   "layout_label": "fallback_line",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 577.726,
   "first_line_x": 577.5,
   "offset": -0.226,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "6/(cid:20)(cid:20)/26 (cid:20)(cid:19):(cid:19)(cid:19) (cid"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#0",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 78.112,
   "first_line_x": 78.112,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "<style id='1'>34</style><style id='3'> </style>AramcoWorld"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#1",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 216.066,
   "first_line_x": 238.066,
   "offset": 22.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "希贾兹铁路的起源"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#2",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 181.565,
   "first_line_x": 199.14,
   "offset": 17.575,
   "lines": 4,
   "excerpt": "希贾兹铁路的建设始于1900年9月1日，按照奥斯曼苏丹阿卜杜勒·哈米德二世的命令进行，当时正值帝国衰落的年代。奥斯曼帝国"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#3",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 181.805,
   "first_line_x": 197.53,
   "offset": 15.725,
   "lines": 3,
   "excerpt": "这条铁路预计将发挥三个功能。从政治上讲，阿卜杜勒·哈米德希望将奥斯曼帝国领土的边缘重新连接到他的控制最强的中心。"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#4",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 388.583,
   "first_line_x": 407.083,
   "offset": 18.5,
   "lines": 6,
   "excerpt": "从军事上讲，这条铁路将作为对抗欧洲帝国主义的堡垒，允许在地中海和红海的防御阵地进行增援。从宗教上讲，它将取代传统的前往麦"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#5",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 388.639,
   "first_line_x": 407.139,
   "offset": 18.5,
   "lines": 7,
   "excerpt": "所有三个目标都很重要，专门研究该主题的专家泽克里亚·库尔顺教授在伊斯坦布尔对我说，“但宗教原因被提升到了其他之上。” 这"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#6",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 388.657,
   "first_line_x": 407.157,
   "offset": 18.5,
   "lines": 10,
   "excerpt": "“最独特的方面是它的资金来源，”库尔顺补充道。阿卜杜勒·哈米德亲自捐款，并在帝国内征税，同时还得到了全球穆斯林社区的自愿"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#7",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 388.481,
   "first_line_x": 406.981,
   "offset": 18.5,
   "lines": 7,
   "excerpt": "库尔顺表示，奥斯曼当局部署了数千名军事征召兵来修建铁路，他们工作的地形险峻多变，且往往远离城市中心。在他2005年出版的"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#8",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 388.768,
   "first_line_x": 407.268,
   "offset": 18.5,
   "lines": 5,
   "excerpt": "另一个因素是地形的多样性，这需要非常不同的施工技能。在叙利亚，路线穿过一个名为豪兰的火山高原。在那里，有些年份会有大量降"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#9",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 388.657,
   "first_line_x": 407.157,
   "offset": 18.5,
   "lines": 5,
   "excerpt": "这里线路的推进需要数百座桥梁、水渠和涵洞来管理排水。在亚尔穆克山谷——一个令人惊叹的陡峭地裂（现为叙利亚和约旦的边界），"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#10",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 388.657,
   "first_line_x": 407.157,
   "offset": 18.5,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "“铁路工人必须克服许多技术困难，”Nicholson写道。"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#11",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 78.309,
   "first_line_x": 93.509,
   "offset": 15.2,
   "lines": 10,
   "excerpt": "<style id='1'>下面</style> 工人在1906年于塔布克附近铺设铁路。希贾兹铁路的建设需要成千上万的军"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#12",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 34.574,
   "first_line_x": 34.0,
   "offset": -0.574,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "16344araD9R1.indd 34"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#13",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 583.726,
   "first_line_x": 583.726,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "6/{v1}/{v2}:{v3}下午"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#0",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 490.295,
   "first_line_x": 490.295,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "<style id='1'>2026年7月/8月</style>35"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#1",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 78.157,
   "first_line_x": 93.882,
   "offset": 15.725,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "具有讽刺意味的是，这些困难还包括豪兰以南大部分路段缺乏水源，以及当地可用燃料资源的严重短缺。"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#2",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 78.083,
   "first_line_x": 96.583,
   "offset": 18.5,
   "lines": 9,
   "excerpt": "即使在这个时代，沿着这条路线的旅程依然充满挑战。我在冬季穿越了叙利亚和约旦北部，夜晚在气温勉强达到华氏40度（摄氏4度）"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#3",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 78.148,
   "first_line_x": 96.648,
   "offset": 18.5,
   "lines": 5,
   "excerpt": "到1908年，工程师们已将铁路延伸至麦地那，六年后，他们将一条支线连接到地中海。但由于当地部落不愿放弃他们传统的朝觐朝圣"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#4",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 78.157,
   "first_line_x": 95.732,
   "offset": 17.575,
   "lines": 5,
   "excerpt": "尽管如此，对于这个衰落的帝国来说，这仍然是一个巨大的成功。1909年，法国语言学家夏尔-厄德·博南在学术期刊《地理学年鉴"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#5",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 78.139,
   "first_line_x": 96.639,
   "offset": 18.5,
   "lines": 5,
   "excerpt": "围绕铁路的乐观情绪并没有持续多久。不到十年后，在第一次世界大战期间，铁路多次遭到袭击。袭击队摧毁了包括阿尔·朱哈尼在乌拉"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#6",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 285.157,
   "first_line_x": 303.657,
   "offset": 18.5,
   "lines": 3,
   "excerpt": "在现在的沙特阿拉伯境内，希贾兹铁路的最后一列火车于1925年出发。到上个世纪中叶，它已陷入失修状态，甚至连铁轨都被拆除。"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#7",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 309.698,
   "first_line_x": 330.598,
   "offset": 20.9,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "从过去到未来的蒸汽前进"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#8",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 284.981,
   "first_line_x": 302.556,
   "offset": 17.575,
   "lines": 4,
   "excerpt": "几十年来，各种努力都在进行，以恢复希贾兹路线。最显著的是在20世纪60年代，沙特阿拉伯北部的工作涉及重建路堤和更换破旧的"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#9",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 285.305,
   "first_line_x": 301.955,
   "offset": 16.65,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "然而，希贾兹的痕迹仍然在该地区存在，散布在沙漠、城市、废弃的车站中，甚至成为旅游景点。"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#10",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 285.157,
   "first_line_x": 303.657,
   "offset": 18.5,
   "lines": 3,
   "excerpt": "自2023年以来，我一直在探索这条路线，多次返回以收集过去时代的记忆。它的起点由大马士革市中心宏伟的希贾兹火车站标志着，"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#11",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 510.176,
   "first_line_x": 526.176,
   "offset": 16.0,
   "lines": 7,
   "excerpt": "希贾兹铁路经过约旦北部的希尔贝特·萨姆拉站，靠近马夫拉克市——巧合的是，马夫拉克在阿拉伯语中意为“十字路口”。"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#12",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
