   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 132.945,
   "first_line_x": 132.945,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "阿尔罕布拉宫在历史的十字路口：十九世纪长久的东西方视野。"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#4",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 133.468,
   "first_line_x": 145.368,
   "offset": 11.9,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "埃德赫姆·埃尔德姆。爱丁堡大学出版社，2024年。"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#5",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 133.062,
   "first_line_x": 147.062,
   "offset": 14.0,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "<style id='1'>阿尔罕布拉宫在历史的十字路口</style>展示了位于格拉纳达的13世纪安达卢西亚宫殿建筑群"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#6",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 78.154,
   "first_line_x": 92.154,
   "offset": 14.0,
   "lines": 15,
   "excerpt": "现代西班牙，同时产生了经常相互矛盾的意义——这些意义是被积极构建的，有时也被误读。伊斯坦布尔的历史教授埃德赫姆·埃尔德姆"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#7",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 137.502,
   "first_line_x": 137.502,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "中世纪的建筑与情感"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#8",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 138.018,
   "first_line_x": 152.018,
   "offset": 14.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "保罗·宾斯基。加州大学出版社，2024年。"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#9",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 137.633,
   "first_line_x": 151.633,
   "offset": 14.0,
   "lines": 4,
   "excerpt": "从开篇起，保罗·宾斯基的《中世纪的建筑与情感》将读者带入一个复杂的、多感官的世界。它揭示了一个核心主张：中世纪建筑不仅仅"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#10",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 78.252,
   "first_line_x": 92.252,
   "offset": 14.0,
   "lines": 12,
   "excerpt": "它积极地影响了人们对它的感知和感受。宾斯基，这位剑桥大学中世纪艺术史的名誉教授，通过引用古典、圣经和中世纪的文本，展示了"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#11",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 361.239,
   "first_line_x": 389.239,
   "offset": 28.0,
   "lines": 3,
   "excerpt": "“索贝克涅费鲁如幽灵般存在于黑暗中，她的故事总是隐藏在神秘和想象的面纱之后。”"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#12",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 413.693,
   "first_line_x": 428.693,
   "offset": 15.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "—第一位女性法老"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#13",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 357.171,
   "first_line_x": 357.171,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "第一位女性法老：索贝克涅费鲁，七星女神。"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#14",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 397.057,
   "first_line_x": 407.557,
   "offset": 10.5,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "安德鲁·柯林斯。Bear & Company，2023年。"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#15",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 353.69,
   "first_line_x": 371.265,
   "offset": 17.575,
   "lines": 25,
   "excerpt": "<style id='1'>在</style><style id='3'>《第一位女性法老：索贝克涅费鲁，七星女神》</"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#16",
   "layout_label": "fallback_line",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 34.574,
   "first_line_x": 34.0,
   "offset": -0.574,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "16344araD11R1.indd 40"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#17",
   "layout_label": "fallback_line",
