   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 496.356,
   "first_line_x": 496.356,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "<style id='1'>2026年7月/8月 </style>41"
  },
  {
   "page": 9,
   "reference": "p9#1",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 302.057,
   "first_line_x": 316.057,
   "offset": 14.0,
   "lines": 8,
   "excerpt": "Powers和Tagliacozzo长期致力于伊斯兰历史和文化的研究，他们汇集了历史、人类学和政治思想领域的学者。编辑们"
  },
  {
   "page": 9,
   "reference": "p9#2",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 302.239,
   "first_line_x": 316.239,
   "offset": 14.0,
   "lines": 4,
   "excerpt": "特别是三篇文章因其有效地阐明了伊斯兰“世界”的不同角度而脱颖而出——智力的多样性、殖民官僚体制的创伤以及制度改革的主动性"
  },
  {
   "page": 9,
   "reference": "p9#3",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 302.688,
   "first_line_x": 316.688,
   "offset": 14.0,
   "lines": 10,
   "excerpt": "历史学家詹姆斯·皮克特对19世纪布哈拉<style id='1'>经学院</style>的研究，对于那些寻求理解文化流动"
  },
  {
   "page": 9,
   "reference": "p9#4",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 302.197,
   "first_line_x": 314.097,
   "offset": 11.9,
   "lines": 6,
   "excerpt": "转向国家控制机制，本杰明·克劳德·布劳尔关于阿尔及利亚“姓名规范”的文章因其对帝国权力更隐秘机制的冷静分析而引人注目。穆"
  },
  {
   "page": 9,
   "reference": "p9#5",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 456.746,
   "first_line_x": 470.746,
   "offset": 14.0,
   "lines": 4,
   "excerpt": "这位历史学家认为，殖民化的开始不是枪声，而是文件柜，展示了档案如何在暴力平息后仍然造成伤害，跨越几代人重塑生活。"
  },
  {
   "page": 9,
   "reference": "p9#6",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 456.816,
   "first_line_x": 470.816,
   "offset": 14.0,
   "lines": 8,
   "excerpt": "最后，中东历史学家穆罕默德·达拉克乔格鲁对奥斯曼翻译局的评估提供了一个必要的反叙述，重点在于适应而非抹去。该局成立于19"
  },
  {
   "page": 9,
   "reference": "p9#7",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 456.816,
   "first_line_x": 470.816,
   "offset": 14.0,
   "lines": 7,
   "excerpt": "随着这些文章的交汇，一个核心见解浮现：穆斯林社会并不是像一条单一的河流，而是像一个由权力、改革、伦理和历史记忆塑造的世界"
  },
  {
   "page": 9,
   "reference": "p9#8",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 456.97,
   "first_line_x": 470.97,
   "offset": 14.0,
   "lines": 5,
   "excerpt": "在一个奖励简化和响亮确定性的时代，这本书提供了一个罕见的有纪律的思考邀请。它展示了穆斯林生活的动态性、内部多样性和历史纠"
  },
  {
   "page": 9,
   "reference": "p9#9",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 97.552,
   "first_line_x": 115.127,
   "offset": 17.575,
   "lines": 10,
   "excerpt": "<style id='1'>伊斯兰教会</style>以一个坚定的拒绝开篇：伊斯兰教不能被限制在单一的地理、传统或政治形"
  },
  {
   "page": 9,
   "reference": "p9#10",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 484.94,
   "first_line_x": 484.94,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "评论"
  },
