   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 130.523,
   "first_line_x": 130.523,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "作品揭示了层次分明、复杂的伊斯兰政体"
  },
  {
   "page": 9,
   "reference": "p9#14",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 52.25,
   "first_line_x": 52.25,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 46,
   "excerpt": "AGES TOP: UNIVERSITY HISTORY ARCHIVE / GETTY IM"
  },
  {
   "page": 9,
   "reference": "p9#15",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 310.518,
   "first_line_x": 338.518,
   "offset": 28.0,
   "lines": 3,
   "excerpt": "“通过超越地理和时间的界限，我们希望提供一个更长远和更广阔的视角，来观察联系穆斯林社会的纽带。”"
  },
  {
   "page": 9,
   "reference": "p9#16",
